B.anU={"Hello! How are you?":0,"Good morning, sir.":1,"Good afternoon everyone.":2,"Good night, sleep well.":3,"Goodbye, see you tomorrow.":4,"I have to go, see you later.":5,"Hello Maria, how are you?":6,"Thank you very much for your help.":7,"A coffee, please.":8,"- Thank you. - You are welcome.":9,"I am very well, thank you.":10,"Today I feel a bit bad.":11,"Yes, I would like to go.":12,"No, I do not want more.":13,"Sorry, I didn't hear you.":14,"Excuse me, where is the bathroom?":15,"Welcome to our home!":16,"Thank you very much for the gift.":17,"It is late, see you tomorrow.":18,"Goodbye friend, take care.":19,"Hello Pedro! How is everything going?":20,"Pleased to meet you.":21,"Hello, what is your name?":22,"My name is Pedro.":23,"Nice to meet you.":24,"Where are you from?":25,"I am from Spain.":26,"He is my best friend.":27,"Mr. Garcia is not here.":28,"Good morning, Mrs. Lopez.":29,"I speak a little Spanish.":30,"I do not understand what you are saying.":31,"I am a medical student.":32,"My teacher is very strict.":33,"I want to learn a new language.":34,"Mexico is a beautiful country.":35,"I live in a big city.":36,"I have one brother.":37,"I bought two apples.":38,"It is three in the afternoon.":39,"The car has four wheels.":40,"I work five days a week.":41,"I buy fresh bread every day.":42,"I need to drink more water.":43,"I ate a red apple.":44,[u.N]:45,"My mother is a teacher.":46,"His father works in a bank.":47,"I have an older brother.":48,"My little sister is very funny.":49}
